{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-1395" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The vector $u$ has magnitude $8$, the vector $v$ has magnitude $2,$ the angle between $u$ and $v$ is ${100}^{∘}$ and $n$ is the unit vector that points in the direction of $u\\times v.$ Find $u\\times v$ in terms of $n.$ Round your final answer to one decimal place where appropriate." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978168/state.json" "file_sha256" "157ab1fd2cebee673389587c5100d96aaa7a383b9ff9aa9e02d796b570b4b7f1"} {"question" "q-1395" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We use the formula for the cross product and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|u|\\cdot |v|\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot n \\\\  & =8\\cdot 2\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{100}^{∘}\\cdot n \\\\  & =16\\cdot (0.984\\,80…)\\cdot n \\\\  & =(15.756\\,92…)\\cdot n \\\\  & ≈15.8n.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978168/state.json" "file_sha256" "157ab1fd2cebee673389587c5100d96aaa7a383b9ff9aa9e02d796b570b4b7f1"} {"question" "q-1395" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978168/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "4b34abaf915de8c657170e90727be1b7ed7cded69f10f9058eba11e5919b4a6b"} {"question" "q-1395" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978168/state.json" "file_sha256" "157ab1fd2cebee673389587c5100d96aaa7a383b9ff9aa9e02d796b570b4b7f1"} {"question" "q-1395" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "15.8n"] ["math" "16.0n"] ["math" "2.8n"] ["math" "7.8n"] ["math" "